      "transcript_available": true,
      "transcript": ">> HEY, ROSS! IS THAT A MASTODON? [laughter] >> it's a model of one. we found it in the museum's basement. >> I told Ross it would never fit through the front door. >> so what's its nickname? [laughter] we call it Epoch. >> Epoch? like a period of time? exactly, a very long one. >> you know what, it suits him. he's been in that basement forever. >> can we move it this weekend? I'll need at least four people. >> four people and a very big van. [door slams] was that the manager? >> no, that was the wind. relax. okay. I'm relaxed. I'm totally relaxed. >> you don't look relaxed at all. that's because I'm standing next to a mastodon.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.1,
          "text": "Hey, Ross! Is that a mastodon? [laughter]"
        },
        {
          "start": 3.1,
          "end": 7.4,
          "text": "it's a model of one. we found it in the museum's basement."
        },
        {
          "start": 7.4,
          "end": 11.6,
          "text": "I told Ross it would never fit through the front door."
        },
        {
          "start": 11.6,
          "end": 13.4,
          "text": "so what's its nickname?"
        },
        {
          "start": 13.4,
          "end": 16.1,
          "text": "[laughter] we call it Epoch."
        },
        {
          "start": 16.1,
          "end": 18.3,
          "text": "Epoch? like a period of time?"
        },
        {
          "start": 18.3,
          "end": 21.0,
          "text": "exactly, a very long one."
        },
        {
          "start": 21.0,
          "end": 22.9,
          "text": "you know what, it suits him."
        },
        {
          "start": 22.9,
          "end": 26.0,
          "text": "he's been in that basement forever."
        },
        {
          "start": 26.0,
          "end": 27.8,
          "text": "can we move it this weekend?"
        },
        {
          "start": 27.8,
          "end": 30.6,
          "text": "I'll need at least four people."
        },
        {
          "start": 30.6,
          "end": 33.0,
          "text": "four people and a very big van."
        },
        {
          "start": 33.0,
          "end": 35.8,
          "text": "[door slams] was that the manager?"
        },
        {
          "start": 35.8,
          "end": 37.6,
          "text": "no, that was the wind. relax."
        },
        {
          "start": 37.6,
          "end": 40.9,
          "text": "okay. I'm relaxed. I'm totally relaxed."
        },
        {
          "start": 40.9,
          "end": 42.8,
          "text": "you don't look relaxed at all."
        },
        {
          "start": 42.8,
          "end": 46.0,
          "text": "that's because I'm standing next to a mastodon."
        }
      ],
